# package|Name|Description   (chosen for 2 GB RAM / ARM; one line per app, add your own)
libreoffice-writer|LibreOffice Writer|Word processor (heavy: about 400 MB on disk)
libreoffice-calc|LibreOffice Calc|Spreadsheet
libreoffice-impress|LibreOffice Impress|Presentations
libreoffice-l10n-sv|LibreOffice Svenska|Swedish language pack for LibreOffice
chromium|Chromium|Web browser (a second browser, uses more RAM than Firefox)
thunderbird|Thunderbird|Email
vlc|VLC|Video and music player
audacious|Audacious|Light music player
gimp|GIMP|Image editor (heavy)
inkscape|Inkscape|Vector graphics (heavy)
geany|Geany|Light code editor
transmission-gtk|Transmission|BitTorrent client
gnome-calculator|Calculator|Calculator
simple-scan|Simple Scan|Scanner
gnome-disk-utility|Disks|Disk utility
htop|htop|Process viewer
file-roller|File Roller|Archive manager
libreoffice-gtk3|LibreOffice GTK look|Better theme integration for LibreOffice
